      ],
      "content": "HIGH STREET 1. 5252                                                   (East Side)                                                   Nos 17 and 19                                                   (Rose and Crown                                                   Public House) TL 0507 1/47 II 2. C18 front.  Red brick.  2 storeys.  4 sash windows under flat arches, 3 with glazing bars, to 1st floor.  Shop window on right, left central doorway flanked by 2 canted bay windows with cornices.  6 panelled door, 4 panels fielded, 2 flush, and fanlight in elliptically arched reveal and ribbed surround.  Rose and Crown Inn recorded early C16. Listing NGR: TL0557907729"
    }
